# Rename to wards_ahmedabad.csv to activate. ward_name must match the names in
# data/cities.json exactly (case-insensitive). Supply only the columns you have —
# every column you omit falls back to the Census anchor or the modelled value,
# and /v1/census will tell you which fields are which.
#
# Where each column comes from:
#   population            Census 2011 PCA, ward-level (municipal corporation website)
#   elderly_60plus_pct    Census 2011 C-13 age tables
#   outdoor_worker_pct    Census 2011 B-series worker classification
#   informal_housing_pct  Census 2011 slum tables / state slum board ward list
#   ac_ownership_pct      NFHS-5 district factsheet
#   canopy_cover_pct      Sentinel-2 NDVI via Google Earth Engine
#   cooling_centres       municipal Heat Action Plan
#   hospital_beds         district health society
#   asha_workers          NUHM roster
ward_code,ward_name,population,elderly_60plus_pct,outdoor_worker_pct,informal_housing_pct,ac_ownership_pct,canopy_cover_pct,cooling_centres,hospital_beds,asha_workers
